comment4.target=boolean\ isPlayerAround()
comment4.text=\r\n\ Checks\ if\ the\ player\ is\ within\ reach\r\n\ \r\n\ @return\ true\ if\ the\ player\ is\ nearby,\ and\ false\ if\ not\r\n
